*begin poppy
*data normal from to tape compass clino ignoreall
*units length metres
*calibrate tape 0.0
*units compass degrees
*calibrate compass 0.0
*units clino degrees
*calibrate clino 0.0


*include poppy1.svx
*include poppy2.svx
*include poppy3.svx

*equate poppy2.1 poppy3.1
*equate Poppy2.34 Poppy1.46



*end poppy
